<title>POLAND: KREDYT BANK MARCH NET RISES TO PLN 4.4 MLN.</title>
<headline>KREDYT BANK MARCH NET RISES TO PLN 4.4 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-04-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results March</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>MARCH</p>
<p> Net profit					  4.36 vs    1.27</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit				    7.65 vs    2.07</p>
<p> Profit on banking operations		 30.38 vs   13.03</p>
<p> Interest and other related revenues	29.59 vs   19.62</p>
<p>JANUARY-MARCH</p>
<p> Net profit					 11.40 vs    6.28</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit				   19.01 vs   10.47</p>
<p> Profit on banking operations		 67.71 vs   30.33</p>
<p> Interest and other related revenues	84.20 vs   52.99</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish bank is Kredyt Bank SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
